  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TA to EDM in relation to large generation and transmission projects III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to EDM in relation to large generatio and transmission projects in Mozambique will work to improve power generartion which will benefit in country counsumption and export and result in economic development. Specifically the programme will support the development of new investment projects and, development of agreement models and training og EDM personell.</narrative>
  </description>
